do8hxYwso0qdO-jvkx9lZHhHM2Y9r7BwnDrDhB_OZUi0JzM-45GW5E69QodpZVU098&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD23m6IPakDDMNgB2o_1qGWWu5Pwa78ynSiyzSLFzbg2g&oe=6A4A5ADD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1825193875095351", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300897_1825193878428684_7328305366508183245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8J1raaB4SkQQ7kNvwGp-SIu&_nc_oc=AdrYJwrnmsy687Zgc5TcsMqlZx88H3YQOWpAhPYC1AG5Vb8m9HJV1j3Pb2xH71pd_z4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC7XanMaedacUJYysjWK6VJ_vbVBb6o4NRVrnSQL8uB4Q&oe=6A4A57DB"}, "display_name": "Alterland", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Alterland is a next-generation collaboration platform built on **Unreal Engine** to deliver **photorealistic environments, realistic avatars, and seamless multi-user interaction.** It\u2019s built for organizations that need more than just a virtual meeting room.\nWith **PC and standalone headset access,** Alterland is perfect for **workshops, onboarding, training, and education**\u2014all enhanced with **AI-powered tools** that simplify tasks and boost engagement.\n\n**Selfie-based realistic avatars** \u2013 feel truly present with your team or students.\n**3-level access system** \u2013 from personal desks to team rooms to full campuses.\n**Built-in collaboration tools** \u2013 whiteboards, sticky notes, 3D markers, polls, and AI Smart Notes.\n**Optimized for scale** \u2013 from small team meetings to large events or conferences.\n\nWhether you\u2019re hosting a class, running a workshop, or connecting a global team, **Alterland makes remote collaboration feel effortless and real.**", "short_description": "Alterland \u2013 Next-Level VR Collaboration\n\nUltra-realistic spaces and powerful AI tools. Designed for teams, educators, and event hosts who want VR collaboration to feel natural, productive, and scalable."}]}, "deve